# Play test of Cablecar Stacks (CIPlay cablecar_stacks, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the landing
# beach at 53 -47 and the ramp up to the shore station's stack (top 6 m at 36 -30); the supply car's hole at 15 -38 (7 m
# down); the mid station at -8 -45 (28 m), the high station at -40 -9 (44 m); the summit at -4 -4 (55 m), the mast at
# 1.5 -3 (its ladder on the north side, its platform 73 m), the express car at -9.2 -5.5; the landing stage at 55 -50
island Cablecar Stacks
offset 1.1169 -1.1095
expect step 0
expect title The Skyline
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Chicken 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden wheel1spin
expect hidden landing
wait 5

# The shore station: the log, the box; car one has no power; the dive to the supply car for the fuse
walk 54 -47.5 to 53 -47 to 44.5 -39 to 42 -36 h=6
zone shorestation
expect step 1
read Operator's log
expect step 2
open Ticket booth box
use car1
expect message No power
zone wreck
open Supply car's spares box
expect story fuse 1
expect step 3

# The fuse fitted: the wheel spins; car one to the mid station - the screechers; car two to the high station
use fusebox
expect shown wheel1spin
use car1
wait 8
expect step 4
kill Screecher
expect step 5
expect shown wheel2spin
open Mid station box
use car2
wait 8
expect step 6

# The high station: the lineman's note; the brakes - red first is refused; blue, green, red; car three to the summit
read Lineman's note
expect step 7
open High station box
use brakered
expect message Wrong order
use brakeblue
use brakegreen
use brakered
expect shown wheel3spin
use car3
wait 9
expect step 8

# The summit: the bear; the keeper's diary; up the mast for the key; the vault; the express car down to the beach
kill Bear
expect step 9
read Summit keeper's diary
expect step 10
climb 1.5 -2.6 h=55
climb 1.5 -2.6 h=61
climb 1.5 -2.6 h=67
expect stand 2.25 -3.65 h=73 below=75
zone mast
expect step 11
open Mast's key box
expect story vaultkey 1
expect step 12
use express
expect message lamp is dark
open Summit vault
expect step 13
expect shown landing
use express
wait 10
expect done
